## The Bottom Line

While certified pre-owned cars are better to buy than a standard used car, they can still end up being lemons. Make sure to do your homework: verify the vehicle’s certification, check its history report, and don’t skip on having it inspected by an independent mechanic, despite its certified status. Stay vigilant to protect yourself against certified pre-owned car scams in California.

